                                                "text": "Harry Hooper living in No. 10 / He bought a toupee and glued it to his head / \"It looks very natural\" everybody said / But then his wife said \"Toupee, isn't that a French word?\" / And Harry said \"Ole!\" / She said \"That's a Spanish word.\" / And he said \"O.K., can't tell the difference these days.\""
